e a mechanism for accounts to lose their privileges if they are compromised (such as when a trusted device is misplaced). If the calling account had been granted `role`, emits a {RoleRevoked} event. Requirements: - the caller must be `account`."},"revokeRole(bytes32,address)":{"details":"Revokes `role` from `account`. If `account` had been granted `role`, emits a {RoleRevoked} event. Requirements: - the caller must have ``role``'s admin role."}},"version":1},"userdoc":{"kind":"user","methods":{},"version":1}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"HolyPassageV3.sol":"HolyPassageV3"},"evmVersion":"istanbul","libraries":{},"metadata":{"bytecodeHash":"ipfs"},"optimizer":{"enabled":true,"runs":200},"remappings":[]},"sources":{"HolyPassageV3.sol":{"keccak256":"0x7be5f69927ad136890d622a6f4a2091aa6ed9e12861dfe291641d1c22002146d","license":"MIT","urls":["bzz-raw://3313541feb9a9d877b09313c324cf149ff3111c98937e37c9a3ed3dc00c739b9","dweb:/ipfs/QmbeE6yjUVmVDWGf83iACCBSuBox4tpJx5gFxeKUQgPa1p"]}},"version":1}